                        "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"pv-wrap\"><p class=\"kicker\">Character archive</p><h1>Guardians of the fracture.</h1><p class=\"hero-copy\">Filter the archive and open a keyboard-accessible profile for each original character.</p></div></section><section class=\"page-section\"><div class=\"pv-wrap\"><div class=\"filter-strip\" aria-label=\"Character filters\"><button class=\"pv-filter\" data-alignment=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button class=\"pv-filter\" data-alignment=\"hero\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Heroes</button><button class=\"pv-filter\" data-alignment=\"villain\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Rivals</button></div><div class=\"character-grid\"><article class=\"character-card\" data-character=\"hero\"><div class=\"character-art\"></div><div class=\"character-info\"><span class=\"power\">Light architecture</span><h3>Nova Circuit</h3><p>Engineer Mara Voss builds temporary hard-light tools from mathematical sketches.</p><button class=\"profile-btn\" type=\"button\" data-profile data-name=\"Nova Circuit\" data-copy=\"Engineer Mara Voss builds temporary hard-light tools from mathematical sketches. Each profile is an original character entry managed through the WordPress content model.\">Open profile -></button></div></article><article class=\"character-card\" data-character=\"hero\"><div class=\"character-art\"></div><div class=\"character-info\"><span class=\"power\">Kinetic echo</span><h3>Rift Runner</h3><p>Ilyas Reed stores movement and releases it through acrobatic jumps.</p><button class=\"profile-btn\" type=\"button\" data-profile data-name=\"Rift Runner\" data-copy=\"Ilyas Reed stores movement and releases it through acrobatic jumps. Each profile is an original character entry managed through the WordPress content model.\">Open profile -></button></div></article><article class=\"character-card\" data-character=\"hero\"><div class=\"character-art\"></div><div class=\"character-info\"><span class=\"power\">Shadow memory</span><h3>Vanta Echo</h3><p>Dr. Sena Kade reads emotional history preserved inside darkness.</p><button class=\"profile-btn\" type=\"button\" data-profile data-name=\"Vanta Echo\" data-copy=\"Dr. Sena Kade reads emotional history preserved inside darkness. Each profile is an original character entry managed through the WordPress content model.\">Open profile -></button></div></article><article class=\"character-card\" data-character=\"hero\"><div class=\"character-art\"></div><div class=\"character-info\"><span class=\"power\">Living systems</span><h3>Verdant Warden</h3><p>A guardian grown by the Verdant Engine to negotiate with humanity.</p><button class=\"profile-btn\" type=\"button\" data-profile data-name=\"Verdant Warden\" data-copy=\"A guardian grown by the Verdant Engine to negotiate with humanity. Each profile is an original character entry managed through the WordPress content model.\">Open profile -></button></div></article><article class=\"character-card\" data-character=\"villain\"><div class=\"character-art\"></div><div class=\"character-info\"><span class=\"power\">Probability erasure</span><h3>Null Crown</h3><p>The Dominion intelligence removes futures until only obedience remains.</p><button class=\"profile-btn\" type=\"button\" data-profile data-name=\"Null Crown\" data-copy=\"The Dominion intelligence removes futures until only obedience remains. Each profile is an original character entry managed through the WordPress content model.\">Open profile -></button></div></article><article class=\"character-card\" data-character=\"villain\"><div class=\"character-art\"></div><div class=\"character-info\"><span class=\"power\">Signal corruption</span><h3>Red Static</h3><p>A pirate broadcaster who turns public fear into physical interference.</p><button class=\"profile-btn\" type=\"button\" data-profile data-name=\"Red Static\" data-copy=\"A pirate broadcaster who turns public fear into physical interference. Each profile is an original character entry managed through the WordPress content model.\">Open profile -></button></div></article></div><dialog class=\"pv-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-inner\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close profile\">Close</button><p class=\"kicker\">Character file</p><h2 data-dialog-title></h2><p data-dialog-copy></p></div></dialog></div></section>"
